  "title": "EEHRxF Imaging Manifest Document Access Provider CapabilityStatement",
  "description": "CapabilityStatement for the EEHRxF Imaging Manifest Document Access Provider actor. This composite actor\nprovides access to EEHRxF FHIR Documents by serving them to Document Consumers via query APIs.\n",
